<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 274 0 R
/E (The artworks each include a screen, fitted inside a custom flight case. The flight case functions as a coffin, ossuary or reliquary for the skeletons. Flight cases are mainly used to store and transport fragile or valuable equipment, such as audio equipment for large-scale concerts. The flight case is made using strong materials that can withstand impact, with options  to include customised foam inside to prevent shock to the equipment. The exterior is reinforced with metal edges to protect the case.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
